  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685683" data-guid="7685683"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685683" data-guid="7685683" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685683_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">5-6-2019</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 7.21.19</span></span>]</div><div class="para">Information relative to the existence of a snow emergency, when commenced and regulations pertaining thereto can be obtained by calling 518-476-SNOW.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685684"
      id="7685684"
      data-guid="7685684"
      data-position="7996"
      data-full-title="§ 359-36: Rules and regulations. "
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
